OL,3,GNEWSAMore than half of Scotland's
OL,4,Auniversities spend more than they earn
OL,5,A- report
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than half of Scotland's
OL,8,Funiversities spent more money than they
OL,9,Fbrought in during the 24/25 academic
OL,10,Fyear, according to a new report.
OL,12,FThe Scottish Funding Council, the body
OL,13,Fthat allocates public money to higher
OL,14,Feducation, found that 10 universities
OL,15,Fwere in deficit and predicts it will be
OL,16,Fthe same in the coming year, despite
OL,17,Fmore funding.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
