OL,3,GNEWSAMore than half of Scotland's
OL,4,Auniversities spend more than they earn
OL,5,A- report
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt warns that the situation could get
OL,8,Fworse if expected income from
OL,9,Finternational students does not arrive,
OL,10,Fdescribing some forecasts as
OL,11,F"optimistic".
OL,13,FThe report said that three of
OL,14,FScotland's "ancient" universities `
OL,15,FEdinburgh, Glasgow and St Andrews -
OL,16,Frecorded the largest surpluses and it
OL,17,Fwas the more modern universities that
OL,18,Fwere often in deficit.
